# Copy to .env.local and fill in.

# --- Sign-in (Clerk) ---
# Leave both unset in development: Clerk's keyless mode creates temporary keys on first load
# and shows a "Claim application" prompt to attach them to your Clerk account.
# For staging and production, copy the keys from https://dashboard.clerk.com (API keys).
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_...
# CLERK_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_IN_URL=/sign-in
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLERK_SIGN_UP_URL=/sign-up

# Local role testing without Clerk: pick a seeded user (Prem, Rahul, Riya) from the account menu.
# Refused in production.
# AUTH_MODE=dev

# --- Database ---
# Leave unset to use the built-in local Postgres (PGlite, stored in .data/).
# Set it to a hosted Postgres (Supabase or Neon, Mumbai region) for staging and production,
# then run `npm run db:migrate`. Connect as the database owner; queries drop to app_user per request.
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:password@host:5432/growth_os

# --- Email (Resend) ---
# Invite emails. Without a key, invites are still created and the page shows the link to copy or share on WhatsApp.
# Create a key at https://resend.com/api-keys. Until you verify a domain, Resend only delivers from
# onboarding@resend.dev to your own Resend account email.
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_...
# EMAIL_FROM="Growth OS <team@your-domain.in>"

# Public address used in email links. Required in production.
# APP_URL=https://app.your-domain.in

# --- AI Copilot (Claude) ---
# Create a key at https://platform.claude.com (API keys). Without it, AI features show a setup message.
# AI usage is metered in credits (1 credit = US$0.01) against each organisation's monthly budget.
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
